      "code": "def longest_unique_substring(s):\n    last = {}\n    start = 0\n    best = 0\n    for i, ch in enumerate(s):\n        if ch in last and last[ch] >= start:\n            start = last[ch] + 1\n        last[ch] = i\n        if i - start + 1 > best:\n            best = i - start + 1\n    return best",
