      "code": "def edit_distance(a, b):\n    if len(a) < len(b):\n        a, b = b, a\n    prev = list(range(len(b) + 1))\n    for i, ca in enumerate(a, 1):\n        curr = [i]\n        for j, cb in enumerate(b, 1):\n            curr.append(min(prev[j] + 1, curr[j - 1] + 1, prev[j - 1] + (ca != cb)))\n        prev = curr\n    return prev[-1]",
